&\leq \log \left( \sum_{k=0}^t \left(nC_{l_{xy}} \bar{a} \bar{z}_{k+1} + nC_{l_{xy}} \bar{b} \sqrt{k} + nC_{f_x} \right)^2 + [\bar{m}^x_0]^2 \right) + 1 \notag \\
